    {
      "id": 1,
      "slug": "note",
      "pos": {
        "x": 40.0,
        "y": 40.0
      },
      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Gears and envelopes give 0 to 1, and a knob wants its own range. Reframe Range maps the Ping-pong onto a radius of 0.2 to 0.8 in one node; a Multiply then an Add does the same by hand, times 0.3 and minus 0.15 making a rock of 0.15 turn either way. Math on numbers gives numbers, the diamond ports: try Out Min above Out Max to turn the pulse round."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
